WEBVTT

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.120
Hello?

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.320
Morning, Darts'un!

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.160
You still in bed?

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.180
Yeah, I am.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.520
Come on! It's 5 AM!

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.080
Get up already!

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.080
It's training time!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.580
You promised you'd help me out.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.850
Oh, that's right.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.340
<i>I'm Maeda Kazuya, sixteen years old.</i>

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.520
<i>I'm in my second year at Kouga Academy High School.</i>

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:38.430
<i>My dad gave me a camera this spring, after which
I joined the troublemakers in the Photography Club.</i>

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:38.430
Here

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:44.120
<i>I used to live a boring and unchanging life,</i>

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.770
<i>but that suddenly changed.</i>

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:53.340
<i>And somehow, I'm now stuck with helping my childhood friend, Masaki Nonoka, with her morning practices.</i>

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:32.000
Ah, there he is!

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:34.250
Morning, Darts'un!

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.090
<i>A moment in which a distinct reality was singled out</i>

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:42.800
<i>from the countless possible intertwined truths.</i>

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:49.140
<i>That's what happened when Masaki Nonoka asked me to join her morning practices.</i>

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:54.080
Morning, Darts'un!

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:56.010
Oh, Nonoka.

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:56.730
Morning.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.610
Working hard on your photography?

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.550
Yeah.

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:02.200
I've been running around campus taking all sorts of photos.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.070
Cool.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:07.120
But there's barely anyone who's willing to model for me.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:10.080
Whenever I ask them to pose like in
gravure mags, they refuse right away.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.330
Hey, how about I model for you?

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:13.200
Huh?

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.250
You want gravure poses, right?

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.580
As long as you don't show anyone else...

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.220
I'd be okay with doing that.

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:21.720
Really?!

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.720
But I want a favor in return.

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:26.470
A favor?

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:31.850
<i>She wanted me to be her training partner.</i>

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:35.860
<i>Nonoka wanted to throw risers as good as
pitchers from the top softball league schools.</i>

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:40.360
Ninety-six! Ninety-seven! Ninety-eight!

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.470
Ninety-nine! One hundred!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.120
No more!

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.260
I managed to do a hundred squats!

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:51.370
Good job on that! I'm impressed.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:55.380
I want to do some pitching practice next, by the way.

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:58.880
Pitching practice?

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:05.000
Squat down with your heels off
the ground, like a sumo wrestler.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:08.390
It's pretty hard to hold this position.

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:12.280
Hey! This is just like doing a squat!

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:15.270
You totally wanted me to be a catcher from the start!

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:17.270
Oh, you figured it out?

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:21.030
I have this horrible feeling I'm the victim of some elaborate scheme.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:24.390
Don't sweat the little things!

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:26.220
All right, let's do this!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:28.030
Take that!

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.840
Ow...

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:35.670
Nonoka agreed to model for me,

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:38.690
so I'd better study up on my photography.

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.220
Hm...

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:48.340
Adjust white balance to better capture skin tones, huh?

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:50.220
Who's there?

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.600
What are you doing here?

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.750
Oh, photography?

00:04:55.750 --> 00:05:00.500
You said you'd model for me,
so I figured I'd study up on it first.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.440
Oh, you're really taking this seriously, Darts'un!

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.160
Of course I am.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:06.950
As serious as you are about your riser.

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:11.680
I see.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:15.250
Kouga Private
Academy High
School

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:19.210
<i>A few days later, something significant happened that intertwined our strings of fate.</i>

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.920
Oh no, I'm late!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:23.880
I'll have to use...

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:29.220
...the Jumping Nonoka Turn!

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:41.420
Ow!

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:43.780
You allwight, Darts'un?

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.860
Yeah, somehow.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:46.990
What about you?

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.450
I'm okay.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.620
Sorry I wasn't careful.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.240
Watch where you're going!

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:55.250
Ugh, my teeth hurt...

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.170
Hey, did our teeth touch?!

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.420
They did.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.670
That would mean—

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:05.380
We kissed, huh?

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.380
Huh?

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:09.140
But I'm glad it was with you, Darts'un.

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:12.470
I'd be pretty sad if it was with someone I hated.

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:17.560
<i>And that was followed by another decisive event.</i>

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:20.690
Wow...

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.980
What are you working on, Niimi-san?

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.230
Oh, Maeda-kun?

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:34.240
Self-control

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.240
I'm just fixing up Nono-chan's PE bag.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.820
It got ripped the other day.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:33.200
I was gonna buy a new one, but...

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.880
All right! Done!

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:36.340
Wow, it's so cute!

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:37.910
It's perfect!

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:41.170
There was some leftover felt from
home econ, and it was just the right size.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:43.750
Thanks so much, Haruru! I'll give it lots of love!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.470
"Niimi-san's pretty good at sewing."

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.220
"She's really girlish."

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.260
That's what you're thinking.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.010
Wh-Where did that come from?

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:56.640
Yeah, yeah! I can't sew to save my life!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.020
Hey, I never said that.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.900
But your eyes did.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:04.570
Thank you so much, Haruru.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:05.690
See you!

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:06.900
Okay, see you.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.150
Bye, Nonoka.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:12.030
Hmph! No judging me against Haruru!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.200
What was that all about?

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.060
I've been waiting for you, Darts'un.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.480
What did you want to talk to me about?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:45.060
This.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.820
Will you accept it?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:49.320
What's that?

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:54.200
A challenge!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:57.200
A-A challenge?

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:57.280
Challenge

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:59.120
A duel, Darts'un!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:04.710
Huh?!

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.680
It's a challenge of love!

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:09.460
Let's have a nice, clean duel!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.470
Y-You're not making any sense at all!

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:23.480
Haruru's your ideal type of girl, isn't she, Darts'un?

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.980
Huh? That's kind of random.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.110
It's not random.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:32.860
I've been watching you since middle school.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:34.950
So... I know.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.410
Well, uh...

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:43.290
Guys usually find that domestic side of a girl attractive...

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:45.420
Is that true in general?

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:46.710
Y-Yeah!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:48.750
That applies to every guy!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:52.760
Does that mean I don't have a chance at all?

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:53.760
Huh?

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:58.760
Darts'un, you're really dense, so I'll say it straight.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:05.640
I love you, Darts'un.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.150
You had no idea?

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:11.400
Challenge

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:16.530
I've loved you for a long time, ever since middle school.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:19.120
I mean, being with you is just so much fun.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:22.750
I always hoped it'd be someone
I could talk about anything with.

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.460
But...

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:26.170
You have Haruru.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:27.670
Nonoka...

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:31.710
I even had my first kiss with the guy I love.

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:35.670
Giving up would be way too sad.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:39.260
So please, let me try!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:44.140
I want to be a girl you can love!

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:47.650
I want you to tell me what I'm lacking!

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.770
What you're lacking?

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:56.150
If I do anything your ideal girl would never do, tell me right away!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:59.160
This is a duel between you and me!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:01.160
Nonoka...

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:04.870
Too much to ask?

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.460
No, it's not.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:07.040
Really?!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.380
Then you'll duel with me?

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:11.710
H-Hold on a second!

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.760
It's the first time a girl has confessed to me, so I don't really know what to say.

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.380
Are you sure I'm good enough?

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.760
There's no point if it isn't you, Darts'un!

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:22.180
Please!

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:24.010
Accept my challenge of love!

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:39.110
All right. I accept your challenge of love.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:41.620
Really?! Thanks!

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.080
All right!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.080
I'm gonna win this for sure!

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:48.580
Bring it.

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:53.880
All right!

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.380
<i>And so, summer began.</i>

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.380
Come at me!

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:59.720
<i>I accompanied Nonoka in her morning practices and in her challenge of love</i>

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:02.470
<i>not only as a return favor for modeling for me,</i>

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:06.480
<i>but also because it had become a major part of my life.</i>

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:17.610
Huh?

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.610
What's up?

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:22.870
Your skin's pretty pale for an athlete.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.000
I get that a lot.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.580
But look, I'm even paler underneath.

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.210
Huh? What's wrong?

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.500
What are you talking about? You really surprised me!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.550
Huh? Why?

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:36.500
You'd see it anyway if I were wearing bloomers.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.580
But you <i>aren't</i> wearing bloomers right now!

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:41.260
Don't you feel shy about flipping up your shorts?!

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:42.510
Shyness!

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:43.970
Learn to be shy!

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:51.320
Just how naive <i>are</i> you?

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.030
I lost a point.

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:57.950
Thanks for the food!

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:59.600
Hey, wait a minute.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:01.910
Are you eating all of that?

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:03.990
Of course I am!

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.160
Think about how it looks.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.540
It looks delicious!

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:09.250
No!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:13.620
Any man would freak out seeing you eat that much!

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.300
I lost another point!

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:24.180
Hey, Darts'un, I request a rematch!

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:25.140
Huh?

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.930
You know, modeling for you.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:30.930
I'll win that point back with my sexy poses!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.560
The beach, then.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:35.690
We're going to the beach!

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:51.250
Let's meet back up here after we've changed.

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:52.000
Okay.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:05.010
I only had sporty swimsuits and
figured they wouldn't work very well,

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.340
so I bought a new one!

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.720
What do you think?

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:12.980
It looks really good on you.

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.910
Thanks a lot, Nonoka.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.990
I wouldn't have gotten all
these great shots without you.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:34.830
Really?

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:35.870
That's good!

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:40.380
But I need to do something more daring.

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:43.380
Like nudes or handbras.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.170
Huh?

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:47.300
Something daring, huh?

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.390
Nude photography?

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.350
How 'bout we join you for your shoot?

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:56.270
Darts'un...

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.380
Hold this.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:02.440
What's your problem?

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:06.450
<i>Nonoka's trying her best for my sake.</i>

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:10.240
<i>I'm gonna protect her no matter what!</i>

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:11.870
You think you're so brave—

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.750
Nonoka! Run!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:19.000
O-Okay!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.000
Th-That bastard!

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:25.880
Wait right th—

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:46.150
Sorry.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.650
I shouldn't have mentioned handbras and stuff.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:52.070
Man, what kind of gravure mags have you been looking at?

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.870
I don't want shots of you like that.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:15:00.170
You looked wonderful and natural in all the shots I got of you today.

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.420
That's more than good enough.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.670
Darts'un...

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.670
You're so nice, Darts'un.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.550
You think about my feelings.

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:15.680
But I wouldn't be satisfied unless I do it.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:16.560
Huh?

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.850
How's this?

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:25.860
Something like a handbra.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.450
<i>The second term started.</i>

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:42.330
<i>She was just a step away from mastering her riser.</i>

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:45.040
Why am I doing this alone?

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:50.300
Crap!

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:52.970
I'd better apologize to Uchida.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:57.810
What's this doing here?

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.270
<i>No way...</i>

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:42.560
That's our ace!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:45.730
You sure you should be slacking off here?

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:48.610
Well, you see...

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:51.240
I kinda felt like taking a break today.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:54.660
What's wrong? You seem down.

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.740
Yeah, a little.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:59.200
When's our next training session?

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.910
I'm looking forward to it.

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:04.250
Seeing you master your riser, that is.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.460
Darts'un...

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.150
You're acting kind of weird.

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:11.300
I think so too.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:15.300
You see, I don't want to master my riser.

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:16.370
Huh?

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:17.800
What do you mean?

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:22.270
I want to master it for both my own sake and my team's.

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:26.310
But once I've got it down, our training sessions will end.

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:29.440
They'll end...

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:33.990
And then I won't be able to spend time with you.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:36.820
Um...

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:40.450
I had a lot of fun this summer.

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:42.700
That goes for both the training

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:46.330
and the challenge of love that I
didn't really understand at first.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:47.290
Yeah.

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.580
I had fun too.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.550
I took a lot of photos as well, so it's all recorded.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:55.720
I think we made some really great memories.

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:57.720
Yeah.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:05.600
Like, I don't really know, but those memories
won't disappear even if you master your riser.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:10.900
So it's not like we'd be back where we started.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:13.480
Let's do something else together.

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:15.540
Darts'un...

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:20.410
Hey, can I take pictures of your pitching form?

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:21.370
Now?

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.450
Yeah.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:26.710
I've been catching for you this whole time, so I don't have any photos of you pitching.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:28.710
But I'm in my uniform.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:29.960
And we don't have a ball.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.500
That's perfectly fine.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.250
Okay!

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.380
Throw it like you mean it!

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:40.140
Put everything you've got into this riser!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.640
Okay, I understand.

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:54.400
<i>And then, the moment came.</i>

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:08.500
It's rising!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.300
You did it!

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:18.470
You did it, Nonoka!

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:20.220
Yeah!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:22.510
Thanks, Darts'un!

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:29.020
<i>That was the end of our training together.</i>

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:33.860
<i>Summer passed, and fall came.</i>

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.820
<i>I asked Nonoka to come see me.</i>

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:41.860
Ready for the results?

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:44.490
Um, uh... yeah.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.120
I'm really nervous.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:48.450
Nonoka.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:49.580
Yes?

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.460
I concede.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:54.460
Huh?

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:57.090
Your charms have bested me.

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.670
You're always so cheerful and full of energy.

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.590
You're always thinking about me.

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:06.970
How did I never realize that such a
wonderful girl was right next to me?

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.350
Darts'un...

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:09.720
I...

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:11.310
Um, uh...

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.390
I...

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:15.280
I love...

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:16.730
I love you!

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:18.230
I really love you!

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:21.190
Really?

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.110
You're not lying?

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.490
I'm not dreaming?

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:25.740
Really.

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:28.290
I'm not lying, and you're not dreaming.

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:31.250
I love you!

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:33.290
Darts'un...

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:38.250
You said you love me, Darts'un.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.670
Nonoka...

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:43.760
Since we first met in middle school and started talking to each other,

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.010
I couldn't stop thinking about you.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:49.010
I couldn't keep my eyes off you.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:55.230
You're such a wonderful girl that I barely deserve to have you.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:21:00.030
The one who kept losing points
throughout the challenge of love...

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:01.400
was me.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:08.160
Your honest and straightforward feelings gradually won me over.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.410
And now I love you more than anyone else.

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:16.420
I love you so much, Nonoka.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:18.960
I'm so happy!

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:21.170
I'm way too happy!

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:23.550
I love you so much!

00:21:32.170 --> 00:21:35.960
I can see myself in your eyes.

00:22:00.550 --> 00:22:04.550
<i>After that, my life was like a dream.</i>

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:06.550
<i>I'm glad my feelings came through.</i>

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:09.590
<i>I'm glad you fell in love with me.</i>

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:11.900
<i>Softball and photography.</i>

00:22:11.900 --> 00:22:16.480
<i>Our passions may be different, but we're both giving them everything we've got.</i>

00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:18.730
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:21.980
<i>You gave me so much strength.</i>

00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:23.280
<i>I'm grateful.</i>

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:25.110
<i>And...</i>

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:28.160
<i>I really, really, really love you!</i>

00:24:05.450 --> 00:24:06.680
Sakura Mai.

00:24:06.680 --> 00:24:10.020
A rhythmic gymnastics angel that seeks beauty with arms and legs that do not quite reach.

00:24:10.020 --> 00:24:13.680
Born on November 30th. Sagittarius. Blood type A.

00:24:13.680 --> 00:24:15.480
Bust, still developing,

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:17.640
but with no signs of growth.

00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:19.880
Hips, quite small.

00:24:19.880 --> 00:24:21.600
In other words, a childish body.

00:24:21.990 --> 00:24:22.860
Maeda!

00:24:22.860 --> 00:24:25.220
The flower bud blooms but this very moment!

00:24:25.220 --> 00:24:27.110
Capture it! Every inch of the angel!

00:24:27.610 --> 00:24:30.950
Angelic Erotical!

00:24:30.950 --> 00:24:33.880
All men love leotards.
